## Original draft

       Project Document: World Builder (v1.0)

    1. Project Overview
This is the core world building app for a massively multiplayer online role-playing game. We will start with smaller games and iterate to expand the scope so that the core code can be well exercised before we invite the masses. The World Builder component builds out how basic NPCs interact with their environment and respond to one another.
