            a) Creature: <Abstract >
This defines all of the basic elements of a creature in the world.
                • Properties:
##### Stat based properties
                    ◦ statFit <int> : Your general physical fitness (strength)
                    ◦ currPointFit <num> : Current amount of fit available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointFit <num> : Maximum amount of fit available to exert
                    ◦ statEndurance <int> : The amount of physical exertion that you can spend before fatigue sets in
                    ◦ currPointEnd <num> : Current amount of Endurance available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointEnd <num> : Maximum amount of Endurance available to exert
                    ◦ statWill <int> : The ability to continue pushing through exhaustion or injury just through sheer stubbornness
                    ◦ currPointWill <num> : Current amount of Will available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointWill <num> : Maximum amount of Will available to exert
                    ◦ statComposure <int> : The ability to keep your head during stressful situations
                    ◦ curPointComp <num> : Current amount of composure available to exert
