                    ◦ currPointObserv <num> : Current amount of Observation available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointObserv <num> : Maximum amount of Observation available to exert
                    ◦ statCharm <int> : The ability to convince others to assist you
                    ◦ currPointCharm <num> : Current amount of charm available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointCharm <num> : Maximum amount of charm available to exert
                    ◦ statWit <int> : The ability to think fast on your feet and stay unpredictable in conversation and in combat
                    ◦ currPointWit <num> : Current amount of wit available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointWit <num> : Maximum amount of wit available to exert
                    ◦ statDexterity <int> : The degree to which you can may us quick reflexes to act or react
                    ◦ currpointDex <num> : Current amount of dexterity available to exert
                    ◦ maxPointDex <num> : Maximum amount of dexterity available to exert

#### Motivation traits for NPCs. These will drive there reaction to stimulus in the world, including players, and other NPCs
                    ◦ explorerBuilder <int> : The the degree to which you want to go out and explore the work vs staying home making things pleasant
                    ◦ changeStability <int> : The degree to which you value experiencing new things vs the desire to keep things as they are
                    ◦ compassionSelfInterest <int> : The level to which you will consider the needs of others vs maximizing what’s best for yourself at all costs
                    ◦ communityIndividual <Int> : The amount you feel society should support everyone in it regardless of contribution vs the idea that members of a community should be expected to rely on themselves

			###### Basic info about the NPC
